<v Adrian Schoolcraft>They've just entered my home. And they were in their helmets, and gear, and tasers. They had the special weapon-- basically SWAT.
<v Adrian Schoolcraft>他们刚刚闯进我的家。他们戴着头盔，穿着装备，带着泰瑟枪。他们带着特种武器——基本上就是特警队。

00:45:20.680 --> 00:45:22.390
<v Police Officer>You all right?
<v Police Officer>你还好吗？

00:45:22.390 --> 00:45:24.440
<v Adrian Schoolcraft>Yeah, I think so.
<v Adrian Schoolcraft>嗯，我想是的。

00:45:24.440 --> 00:45:26.890
<v Police Officer>Everybody's worried about you. They haven't heard from you.
<v Police Officer>大家都为你担心。他们一直联系不上你。

00:45:26.890 --> 00:45:28.750
<v Adrian Schoolcraft>Who's worried about me?
<v Adrian Schoolcraft>谁为我担心？

00:45:28.750 --> 00:45:32.100
<v Michael Marino>Adrian, didn't you hear us knocking on this door for a couple of hours?
<v Michael Marino>阿德里安，难道你没听到我们敲这扇门敲了好几个小时吗？

00:45:32.100 --> 00:45:34.710
<v Adrian Schoolcraft>No. Why would I expect anyone to knock on my door?
<v Adrian Schoolcraft>没有。我为什么会期望有人敲我的门？

00:45:34.710 --> 00:45:40.160
<v Michael Marino>I don't know, Adrian. But if you hear somebody knocking, normally you get up and answer it. They were kicking on that door loud and yelling.
<v Michael Marino>我不知道，阿德里安。但如果你听到有人敲门，通常你会起来开门。他们当时在外面拼命踢门还大喊大叫。

00:45:40.160 --> 00:45:41.710
<v Adrian Schoolcraft>I wasn't feeling well.
<v Adrian Schoolcraft>我当时感觉不太舒服。

00:45:41.710 --> 00:45:43.670
<v Michael Marino>All right. Sit down. Sit down.
<v Michael Marino>好吧。坐下。坐下。

00:45:43.670 --> 00:46:04.360
<v Ira Glass>That voice you just heard in Adrian's bedroom is a man of much higher rank than anybody in any of the recordings to this point. He's the number two commander for the NYPD for all of Brooklyn North, Michael Marino. Stephen Mauriello, the head of the 81st precinct, the commander that Adrian contends had been putting pressure on all the officers to deliver better numbers, is also there in the bedroom. He talks next.
<v Ira Glass>你刚才在阿德里安卧室里听到的那个声音，是一个职位比目前为止任何录音中的人都要高得多的人。他是纽约市警察局北部布鲁克林地区的二号指挥官迈克尔·马里诺（Michael Marino）。第81分局的负责人斯蒂芬·毛里埃洛（Stephen Mauriello）——也就是阿德里安所称的一直向所有警官施压以交出更好业绩数据的指挥官——也出现在卧室里。接下来是他在说话。

00:46:04.360 --> 00:46:06.990
<v Stephen Mauriello>You've got everybody worried. They're worried about your safety. All right?
<v Stephen Mauriello>你让大家都担心了。他们担心你的安全。对吧？

00:46:06.990 --> 00:46:07.870
<v Adrian Schoolcraft>Worried about what?
<v Adrian Schoolcraft>担心什么？

00:46:07.870 --> 00:46:17.570
<v Stephen Mauriello>What do you mean, worried about what? They tried calling you. You got-- everybody's been calling you. You just walked out of the precinct, you know? That's what we're worried about. Your safety, your well-being.
<v Stephen Mauriello>什么叫担心什么？他们试过打电话给你。你懂的——每个人都在给你打电话。你刚刚擅自离开了分局，你知道吗？这就是我们所担心的。你的安全，你的安危。

00:46:17.570 --> 00:46:18.820
<v Adrian Schoolcraft>All right. I'm fine.
<v Adrian Schoolcraft>好吧。我很好。

00:46:18.820 --> 00:46:21.270
<v Ira Glass>Why does he keep saying that he's worried about your safety?
<v Ira Glass>他为什么一直说他担心你的安全？

00:46:21.270 --> 00:46:23.720
<v Adrian Schoolcraft>That's his excuse to come into my home.
<v Adrian Schoolcraft>那是他闯入我家的借口。

00:46:23.720 --> 00:46:26.010
<v Stephen Mauriello>Get your stuff on. We're going back to the precinct.
<v Stephen Mauriello>把装备穿上。我们要回分局。

