<v Adrian Schoolcraft>I'm not going back to the precinct.
<v Adrian Schoolcraft>我不会回分局的。

00:46:27.800 --> 00:46:29.830
<v Stephen Mauriello>Adrian, we're going to go back to the precinct.
<v Stephen Mauriello>阿德里安，我们要回分局去。

00:46:29.830 --> 00:46:30.600
<v Adrian Schoolcraft>For?
<v Adrian Schoolcraft>凭什么？

00:46:30.600 --> 00:46:34.420
<v Stephen Mauriello>Because we're going to do it the right way. You can't just walk out of command--
<v Stephen Mauriello>因为我们要按规矩办事。你不能就这样擅离职守——

