<v Adrian Schoolcraft>What's going to be done if I go to the 8-1?
<v Adrian Schoolcraft>如果我去81分局，会怎么样？

00:46:36.830 --> 00:46:39.540
<v Stephen Mauriello>What's going to be done. We're going to investigate why you left.
<v Stephen Mauriello>会怎么样。我们要调查你为什么要离开。

00:46:39.540 --> 00:46:43.420
<v Adrian Schoolcraft>I'm telling you why I left. I was feeling sick.
<v Adrian Schoolcraft>我正告诉你们我为什么要离开。我觉得身体不舒服。

